What Is a Letter to Report a Fraudulent Tax Filing?
A formal notice sent to the Internal Revenue Service reporting that your personal information was used to file fraudulent tax returns or that other tax violations were committed using your identity. The letter documents the incident and requests investigation, correction, and protective measures.

